  "description": "A config-driven .NET tool for deploying .NET applications across one or more servers. Reads a single deploy-config.json, diffs changed files against the project dependency graph to decide what needs deploying, runs unit-test gates and prerequisite installs, then plans and applies a staged rollout - IIS app pools, folder copies, or Velopack packages - with commit-message directives, peer soak delays, rollback, and a full run report.",
